  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L4-139 JorDate entrepreneurial support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L4-139 JorDate entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att &#xf6;ka v&#xe4;rdet av &quot;Jordan Valley Madjool&quot; Dadlar produccerad av sm&#xe5;skaliga b&#xf6;nder till f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;n f&#xf6;r sm&#xe5;           jordbrukare och JorDate anst&#xe4;llda, genom att skapa joint ventures med sm&#xe5;skaliga jordbrukare att producera och exportera certifierade dadlar av h&#xf6;g kvalitet. Avtalspart &#xe4;r Jordanian Date Production and Marketing Company (JorDate), org.nr 26139, Jordanien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the value of Jordan valley Madjool Dates produced by small scale farmers to the benefit of small farmers and JorDate employees, by creating joint ventures with small scale Madjool Date farmers to produce and export high-quality, certified dates. Agreement partner is Jordanian Date Production and Marketing Company (JorDate), org reg no 26139, Jordan.</narrative>
  </description>
